      "content": "CC = gcc\nIHEX2FW = ihex2fw\n\nall: keyspan_pda.fw xircom_pgs.fw\n\n%.fw: %.S\n\t$(CC) -x assembler-with-cpp -P -E -o $*.asm $<\n\tas31 -l $*.asm\n\t$(IHEX2FW) $*.hex $@\n\nclean:\n\trm -f *.asm *.fw *.hex *.lst *.obj\n"
